SUMMARY:Saturday open day (noon to 4 PM)
LOCATION:Liz Christy Garden\, Houston Street between the Bowery and Second Avenue\, New York\, NY
DESCRIPTION:Walk in through the Houston Street gate and tell the gardener on duty you'd like to volunteer. No sign-up needed. Evening hours run until dusk\, so the end time here is approximate.
END:VEVENT
